{
	"name": "dsh-toolbox",
	"version": "0.13.1",
	"description": "DSH 个人工具箱：memory（两层记忆读注入＋写侧工具）＋see_image（图片交视觉模型转述）＋dispatch_plan/review/build/verify 派发装配四件（方案任务书＋按批型配对复核形态＋现成 brief；装配四件传批次名即回填拍板清单）＋dispatch_batch（批次台账：四动作记账、状态从事件现推）＋dispatch_lessons（复盘辅助：读上次复盘之后的增量批、按攒批点位出配对规则修订建议草稿，只出建议不落盘）。单包多工具，逐工具隔离激活。",
	"license": "MIT",
	"type": "module",
	"main": "lib/index.js",
	"exports": {
		".": "./lib/index.js",
		"./package.json": "./package.json",
		"./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
		"./icon": "./icon.svg"
	},
	"dsh": {
		"bundle": {
			"patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
		}
	},
	"files": [
		"lib/**",
		"test/**",
		"scripts/**",
		"locale/**",
		"cordis.patch.yml",
		"icon.svg",
		"README.md",
		"LICENSE"
	],
	"scripts": {
		"test": "node --test",
		"check:memory": "node scripts/check-memory-index.mjs"
	},
	"engines": {
		"node": ">=18",
		"dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0"
	},
	"keywords": [
		"deepseek-harness",
		"dsh",
		"cordis",
		"plugin",
		"memory",
		"vision",
		"dispatch"
	],
	"peerDependencies": {
		"@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0",
		"@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0",
		"@deepseek-ai/schemastery": ">=3.18.4 <4"
	},
	"repository": {
		"type": "git",
		"url": "git+https://github.com/maochouchou4-create/dsh-toolbox.git"
	}
}
